  "notes": "# DevClash 0.1.0-beta.7\n\nJoin the leaderboard directly from the desktop app on macOS, Windows and Linux.\n\n- Add a clear leaderboard invitation and guided browser connection.\n- Enable cloud sync for joining only after your explicit confirmation is returned by the server.\n- Keep joining actionable while confirmation is pending, and distinguish joined accounts awaiting eligible usage from ranked accounts.\n- Carry forward beta.6 local-storage protections, the Linux GLib fix and cloud-sync retry improvements.\n- Keep the ready-to-restart update notice above the footer so account and Share controls remain accessible.\n- Preserve existing account sessions, display preferences and sync consent during upgrades.\n\nThis remains a beta. Signed packages and matching reviewed desktop source are published together.\n\nBuilt locally on native hosts. Source commit: 1842e33c423010d6acb12376a63fc6501391d378.\n",
